            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>The Elise 2 is made from <strong>medical-grade silicone</strong>, a non-porous, hygienic material known for its durability and silky-soft touch. This ensures easy cleaning, long-lasting quality, and maximum comfort during use.</p><p>It features <strong>two independent vibrating motors</strong>, positioned at the base and the tip, which can be used separately or combined. Users can adjust vibration intensity and choose from <strong>five pre-programmed vibration patterns</strong>, all while enjoying minimal noise. The ergonomic design provides a comfortable grip and intuitive access to the control buttons.</p><p>The vibrator is rechargeable, offering up to <strong>4 hours of continuous use</strong>, and includes a charge indicator. Dimensions are <strong>22 cm in length</strong> and <strong>4.5 cm in diameter</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
